                        "entry_id": "5361ffc4-53e0-36da-b7c3-120bef1b53eb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "grote kortharige hond met brede kop"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "749300c4-6d73-4929-88db-4c94721dd0e8",
                                "sense_id": "2d699a20-4d3d-37a5-bd2d-73a2bc5d3652",
                                "text": "De Duitse dog, die ook Deense dog wordt genoemd, is een van de grootste hondenrassen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "82611cba-f966-4175-9613-0a2932585d30",
                        "source_entry_id": "5361ffc4-53e0-36da-b7c3-120bef1b53eb",
                        "source_sense_id": "2d699a20-4d3d-37a5-bd2d-73a2bc5d3652",
                        "source_sense_description": "grote kortharige hond met brede kop",
                        "target_lang_word": "Dogge",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Dogge",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f04b44dc-c20c-37eb-875e-a6093c8f2b73",
                                        "entry_id": "c79f2b29-3029-35a7-b3c3-7c88114ee42d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "große, kräftige Hunderasse, die besonders als Wachhund gehalten wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "497cc447-3630-4375-8620-f44daa4c888c",
                                                "sense_id": "f04b44dc-c20c-37eb-875e-a6093c8f2b73",
                                                "text": "„Ein Gast saß in einem Restaurant und die riesige Dogge eines Nachbars beschnupperte ihn.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "deca824a-e43c-4e88-9491-d5fd5b1f12db",
                                                "sense_id": "f04b44dc-c20c-37eb-875e-a6093c8f2b73",
                                                "text": "„Im Tierheim hatte die Dogge offenbar gelitten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5ab1a16-a46c-441e-abbb-29ecd56cb7e4",
                                                "sense_id": "f04b44dc-c20c-37eb-875e-a6093c8f2b73",
                                                "text": "„Im Jahr darauf schaffte sie sich einen Hund an, eine unmäßig große Dogge, die, betrat nur ein Kerl das Zimmer, schon mit den Zähnen fletschte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "037e5d7b-2090-4ff7-9883-dba86a39d492",
                                                "sense_id": "f04b44dc-c20c-37eb-875e-a6093c8f2b73",
                                                "text": "„Die Doggen bellen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f5c9fede-3d74-482c-be41-6baf0d43aea3",
                        "source_entry_id": "5361ffc4-53e0-36da-b7c3-120bef1b53eb",
                        "source_sense_id": "2d699a20-4d3d-37a5-bd2d-73a2bc5d3652",
                        "source_sense_description": "grote kortharige hond met brede kop",
                        "target_lang_word": "mastiff",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mastiff",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d78a5881-72a4-33a8-b06e-01f9e3f3e1e8",
                                        "entry_id": "8fac52d5-e83d-3bea-b41d-5e8efcf3effa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of an old breed of powerful, deep-chested, and smooth-coated dogs, used chiefly as watchdogs and guard dogs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef6c67ba-8d8c-4b6c-bdb9-8d1a8f9f5d3a",
                                                "sense_id": "d78a5881-72a4-33a8-b06e-01f9e3f3e1e8",
                                                "text": "At which time, they wryte that Demoſthenes told the people of Athens, the fable of the ſheepe and woulues, how that the woulues came on a time, and willed the ſheepe, if they woulde haue peace with them, to deliuer them their maſtiues that kept them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0ae167c-a649-4ac6-8b72-f4eff526bd89",
                                                "sense_id": "d78a5881-72a4-33a8-b06e-01f9e3f3e1e8",
                                                "text": "As ſaluage Bull, whom two fierce maſtiues bayt, / When rancour doth with rage him once engore, / Forgets with wary warde them to awayt, / But with his dreadfull hornes them driues afore, / Or flings aloft or treades downe in the flore, / Breathing out wrath, and bellowing diſdaine, / That all the foreſt quakes to heare him rore: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7bd2f0e-23f3-440d-9d91-8857020d877e",
                                                "sense_id": "d78a5881-72a4-33a8-b06e-01f9e3f3e1e8",
                                                "text": "They fill’d the Capitoll, and Pompei’s Circke: / Where, like ſo many Maſtiues, biting ſtones, / As if his Statues novv vvere ſenſitiue / Of their vvild fury, firſt they teare them dovvne: / Then faſtning ropes, drag them along the ſtreetes, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85cafab3-f3f2-44d3-bd01-99ca801388e7",
                                                "sense_id": "d78a5881-72a4-33a8-b06e-01f9e3f3e1e8",
                                                "text": "Avaunt, you curs! Be thy mouth or black or white, Tooth that poisons if it bite; Mastiff, greyhound, mongrel grim, Hound or spaniel, brach or him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbffd8f2-7cf0-49fb-bcc8-c6362c84922a",
                                                "sense_id": "d78a5881-72a4-33a8-b06e-01f9e3f3e1e8",
                                                "text": "The conquering foe they soon assail’d; / First Trulla stav’d, and Cerdon tail’d, / Until their Mastives loos’d their hold: / And yet alas! do what they could, / The worsted Bear came off with store / Of bloudy wounds, but all before."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "805caa99-9d5f-46de-be18-8a3bc4bb97d4",
                                                "sense_id": "d78a5881-72a4-33a8-b06e-01f9e3f3e1e8",
                                                "text": "Soon as Ulyſſes near th’encloſure drew, / With open mouths the furious maſtives flew: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f6296ee-435d-4a5c-a581-3ca383b204e6",
                                                "sense_id": "d78a5881-72a4-33a8-b06e-01f9e3f3e1e8",
                                                "text": "Her, who did erst the lengthened fight maintain, / And heaped the death-pile red with Prankish gore, / The Vert fangs now to vassalage constrain: / The mastives old and young, Verrucchio bore, / Who in their lawless rule Montagna slew, / Make their teeth augres where they wont of yore: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9b7b8d0-1271-476f-afee-49fd4b87ef61",
                                                "sense_id": "d78a5881-72a4-33a8-b06e-01f9e3f3e1e8",
                                                "text": "The Mastiff is a good fighter, and can kill a wildcat, taking the necessary punishment well, as we found out when we once trapped one of these small lynxes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d3f08aa-ea20-4d71-a43b-10845298cde7",
                                                "sense_id": "d78a5881-72a4-33a8-b06e-01f9e3f3e1e8",
                                                "text": "Neither of them could say how many years it had been since the week-long poisoning epidemic, which first took their father’s bulls, then his mastives, then the man himself; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f9268d4-29a8-4676-9533-69ed24e3e09c",
                                                "sense_id": "d78a5881-72a4-33a8-b06e-01f9e3f3e1e8",
                                                "text": "Milei’s allies reject his portrayal as an unbalanced powder keg, although they do not refute claims their leader takes counsel from his cloned mastiffs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a9267ad3-87cf-4cc9-a349-99df2b864423",
                        "source_entry_id": "5361ffc4-53e0-36da-b7c3-120bef1b53eb",
                        "source_sense_id": "2d699a20-4d3d-37a5-bd2d-73a2bc5d3652",
                        "source_sense_description": "grote kortharige hond met brede kop",
                        "target_lang_word": "dogue",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dogue",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "998a7205-2745-3fcb-a003-937d548991da",
                                        "entry_id": "7b7bda72-4015-3f4f-9fae-570653171172",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Autrefois, initialement un grand chien puissant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7dd885f-d23a-4e53-af54-3a519798bd0e",
                                                "sense_id": "998a7205-2745-3fcb-a003-937d548991da",
                                                "text": "La tête d'un dogue énorme se dessinait dans l'ombre à l'ouverture de la hutte. C'était la niche d'un chien."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aaa4a0fa-a2e2-35ad-b8ca-fcb91bb6df33",
                                        "entry_id": "7b7bda72-4015-3f4f-9fae-570653171172",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Une des races de chien à tête large, au museau court et carré, au cou massif, ainsi qu’à musculature et à mâchoires extrêmement puissantes, le type du chien molossoïde."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14cb9e92-3bc5-4e8d-b02a-ff690bc534a4",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa4a0fa-a2e2-35ad-b8ca-fcb91bb6df33",
                                                "text": "Les dogues étaient autrefois utilisés pour le combat et aujourd’hui comme chiens de garde et chiens de compagnie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75720090-946a-4404-bcb9-63baa6106dd3",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa4a0fa-a2e2-35ad-b8ca-fcb91bb6df33",
                                                "text": "Des enfants poussent des cris, des dogues aboient."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14bb7593-3f90-4861-b21c-89908acd21a4",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa4a0fa-a2e2-35ad-b8ca-fcb91bb6df33",
                                                "text": "Après la mode des labradors et dalmatiens, une nouvelle tendance a suivi : celle des « molosses », American Staffordshire terrier, malinois et autres dogues."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06889d1e-bc2f-46bb-b37d-6c58022005d3",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa4a0fa-a2e2-35ad-b8ca-fcb91bb6df33",
                                                "text": "Chaque soir, lorsque sonnait le couvre-feu, les chiennetiers lâchaient les dogues hors des murs et malheur à qui rôdait alors à travers les grèves où les navires étaient échoués à mer basse […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ebb92cd-fb62-4404-a850-16b9c418feef",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa4a0fa-a2e2-35ad-b8ca-fcb91bb6df33",
                                                "text": "Le bruit de cette chute souleva une tempête de jappements féroces parmi tous les dogues, mâtins et molosses qui faisaient ripaille à la ronde."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51857fab-e541-469c-b78b-08b693e39434",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa4a0fa-a2e2-35ad-b8ca-fcb91bb6df33",
                                                "text": "Sa face, camarde comme celle d’un dogue, était surmontée d’un réseau en fils d’écorces ; il portait un ceinturon en peau de léopard […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6053a4c3-6833-4eec-935f-e756e399d36c",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa4a0fa-a2e2-35ad-b8ca-fcb91bb6df33",
                                                "text": "T’aimera le vieux pâtre,\nSeul, tandis qu’à ton front\nD’albâtre\nSes dogues aboieront."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b563e02-d982-33d0-b33c-46aacf08b411",
                                        "entry_id": "7b7bda72-4015-3f4f-9fae-570653171172",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Surnom des joueurs de l'équipe de football de Lille, le LOSC."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42506187-a5a2-43ba-9b3a-5ebcf8790c61",
                                                "sense_id": "8b563e02-d982-33d0-b33c-46aacf08b411",
                                                "text": "Lille, brillant lors de cette belle affiche, l’avait remporté face à des Parisiens pourtant largement favoris. Le journaliste, bluffé par la prestation des joueurs du Nord, avait vu une équipe qui ne lâchait rien, comme des « chiens », donc des « Dogues ». Une expression qui restera au fil des années et jusqu’à aujourd’hui.."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
